# Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env.local or .env to version control.
#
# Add variables here as you integrate new services:
#
# Example: Analytics
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
#
# Example: Contact form backend
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com/contact
#
# Vite rules:
#  - Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
#  - Access them in code via: import.meta.env.VITE_YOUR_KEY
#  - Never prefix secrets (API keys that call paid services) with VITE_.
#    Those should live in a server-side environment only.
